# Purpose
Helps users prioritise work by outcome, urgency, importance, impact, effort,
risk, and dependencies.

# Key Sections
- Start with the outcome.
- Separate urgent from important.
- Consider impact.
- Consider effort.
- Consider risk.
- Check dependencies.

# Dependencies
- Belongs to the productivity manual set.

# Gotchas
- Prioritisation depends on user goals. Surface assumptions when goals or
  constraints are missing.

